+#   placement_legality:
+#     generator keeps the cross fully in bounds and searches only centers with enough
+#     tip-to-border clearance. Each candidate is validated by the solver itself, and only
+#     samples with at least one collision seam are accepted.
+#   visual_observability:
+#     the change is visible as unfinished corridors and mirrored stopping fronts. The
+#     input stays minimal, so the seam pattern in the output is the only new cue humans
+#     need to infer.
+#   visual_cleanliness:
+#     no extra markers or colors are introduced. Removing the old end-game repair step
